ancient text~
Mighty Messenger - Nyarlathotep:

From the World of the Seven Suns to his earth place, the Wood of N'gai, whither
may come Him Who Is Not to be Named. There shall be abundance of those from
the Black Goat of the Woods, the Goat with the Thousand Young...

Ia! Ia! Shub-Niggurath! Ygnaiih! Ygnaiih!

Ithaqua shall serve thee, Father of the million Favored Ones, and Zhar shall be
summoned from Arcturus, by the command of 'Umr At-Tawil, Guardian of the
Gate... Ye shall unite in praise of Azathoth, of Great Cthulhu, of Tsathoggua.
Go forth in his form or in whatever form chosen in the guise of man, and
destory that which may lead them to us...

Ygnaiih! Y'bthnk... h'ehye-n'grkdl'lh... Ia! Ia! Ia!
